                  "meta": "6 reviews",
                  "rating": 5,
                  "text": "Had a lovely experience taking my daughter here. The optician Fatima is very good with children and made the experience enjoyable for my daughter. The receptionist was also very welcoming."
                },
                {
                  "author": "Neelum Mushtaq",
                  "avatarColour": "#E8710A",
                  "date": "a year ago",
                  "meta": "Local Guide · 11 reviews · 8 photos",
                  "rating": 5,
                  "text": "Took my mum as emergency appointment. A day before spoke to fatima on call, fatima also did a video call for my mum. Got an urgent appointment next morning. Explained next few steps and booked my mum for a follow up appointment for a next week. Highly recommended, great service. 👍"
                },
                {
                  "author": "Hanif Ur-Rehman",
                  "avatarColour": "#A142F4",
                  "date": "5 years ago",
                  "meta": "Local Guide · 60 reviews · 28 photos",
                  "rating": 5,
                  "text": "I have had the pleasure of being a patient of Ward End Eye Care since it first opened a few years ago. I have been extremely impressed by Fatima (the optician), as she has always ensured that she thoroughly checks my eyes during my eye tests. The equipment that Fatima uses is state of the art and the health of her patients is paramount.",
                  "url": "https://share.google/9YZzTiRj2gvW1Xrpr"
                },
                {
                  "author": "Sadia K",
                  "avatarColour": "#34A853",
                  "date": "4 years ago",
                  "meta": "Local Guide · 24 reviews",
                  "rating": 5,
                  "text": "Wow very kind and knows how to treat children of all ages. They will aways fit you in and Fatimah the optometrist will go above and beyond to help with you eye check ups. Definitely recommend"
                },
                {
                  "author": "Ajmal Mohammed",
                  "avatarColour": "#D93025",
                  "date": "2 years ago",
                  "meta": "6 reviews",
                  "rating": 5,
                  "text": "The best optician in birmingham, great customer service from the whole team. Went out they way to see me and my mum and gave great advice."
                },
                {
